        data-refresh-prompt="Refresh the trip plan at trips/2026-07-tokyo-koyoto-and-other-famous/index.html.

Re-run the full planner chain for Fri Jul 10 → Sat Jul 25, 2026 (14 nights), family of 4 (kids 6 + 9), BLR origin, Japan. STRUCTURE IS LOCKED: single Tokyo base at JW Marriott Tokyo for 10 nights (Jul 11–21; Jul 13–21 is an office-provided free stay, Jul 11–13 self-paid on Bonvoy points), then Kyoto Jul 21–25. Two hard pins: (a) work workshop in Tokyo on Thu Jul 16 — family does a self-contained day; (b) office hotel = JW Marriott, do not move bases during Jul 13–21. Fuji, Hakone, Kamakura are DAY TRIPS from Tokyo (no Hakone overnight). Open-jaw flights: arrive NRT, depart KIX.

1. Re-check fares BLR → NRT (Jul 10) and KIX → BLR (Jul 25) as an open-jaw/multicity, vs round-trip NRT. Use scripts/api/amadeus_flights.py first; fall back to the SerpAPI proxy at /api/flights, then web search Skyscanner / Google Flights / Cathay / Malaysia Airlines / JAL / ANA. Note OneWorld (QR/JL/CX/MH) opportunities for Avios redemption.
2. Re-verify the JW Marriott Tokyo Bonvoy points rate for the 2 self-paid arrival nights (Jul 11–13). Re-verify Kyoto Bonvoy properties (Westin Miyako, Ritz-Carlton, Mitsui Luxury Collection) for Jul 21–25 and apply the Marriott 40K free-night cert (expires 2026-12-31) to one Cat-5 night + points for the rest.
3. Re-verify all Foursquare / Google Local entries for vegetarian + shojin ryori restaurants in Tokyo + Kyoto.
4. Recompute budget envelope vs ₹7L Lux cap — note that 8 of the Tokyo nights are office-paid (free), so net paid/points hotel nights = 4 (Kyoto) + 2 (Tokyo arrival). Surface flight cabin upgrades only if exceptionally low.
5. Refresh weather forecast via scripts/api/weather_forecast.py for Jul 10–25 in Tokyo/Kyoto + Kawaguchiko/Hakone day trips with --aqi.
6. Re-verify all booking links resolve (no 404s). Replace any broken hotel page with a Booking.com search URL.
7. Overwrite trips/2026-07-tokyo-koyoto-and-other-famous/index.html using the existing trips/_shared/style.css and trips/_shared/site.js. Maintain structure: Hero → Itinerary → Costs → Hotels → Transport → Veg dining → Door-to-door → Visa & health → Post-trip.
8. Update the card on trips/index.html with the new total cost.

Read .workspace/user_travel_prefs.md and .workspace/loyalty.md before recommending — never override constraints (school days, hotel tier, cabin policy, vegetarian)."
      >
        <svg class="icon icon-sm"><use href="#i-refresh"/></svg>
        Refresh
      </button>
