<!-- ========== ITINERARY ========== -->
<section class="itinerary" id="itinerary">
  <div class="container with-map">
    <aside class="section-with-map__map" data-trip-map="itinerary" aria-label="Map of itinerary stops"></aside>
    <div class="with-map__main">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Day by day · refreshed from your influencer dump (104 images, 151 unique places)</div>
        <h2>The <em>timeline</em></h2>
      </div>
      <p>14 nights · Tokyo 10 (single base) → Kyoto 4 → KIX. Built around the Jul 16 workshop and 8 free office nights at JW Marriott — so Fuji, Hakone &amp; Kamakura run as day trips from Tokyo, and Kyoto sits in the paid tail. Every place was prioritized from your image dump and verified live. Slow pace, kid-energy aware. July is hot &amp; humid (28-32°C, afternoon thunderstorms) — anchors run morning or late afternoon, mid-day = AC + food + transit.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="leg-tabs-head">
      <div class="leg-summary">
        <span><strong>14 nights</strong> · Fri Jul 10 → Sat Jul 25, 2026</span>
        <span>· Family of <strong>4</strong> · BLR origin</span>
        <span>· Vegetarian only · 5★ hotels</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tab-panel active">
      <div class="timeline">

        <!-- DAY 1 — Fri Jul 10 -->
        <details class="day" open>
          <summary>
            <span class="day-marker"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-plane"/></svg></span>
            <div class="day-head">
              <div>
                <div class="day-date">Fri · Jul 10</div>
                <div class="day-title">BLR → NRT · overnight flight</div>
              </div>
              <div class="day-tags">
                <span class="day-tag">Travel</span>
                <span class="day-tag">Sleep on board</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="chev"><svg class="icon icon-sm"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="day-body">
            <div class="row">
              <div class="row-time">Evening</div>
              <div class="row-icon transit"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-plane"/></svg></div>
              <div class="row-content">
                <span class="row-title">BLR → NRT</span> — evening departure, sleep on the plane. See Door-to-door for the full leg breakdown. Pre-order Asian Vegetarian Meal (AVML) for all 4.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- DAY 2 — Sat Jul 11 -->
        <details class="day">
          <summary>
            <span class="day-marker"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-bed"/></svg></span>
            <div class="day-head">
              <div>
