<!-- ========== COSTS ========== -->
<section class="costs" id="costs">
  <div class="container">
    <div id="holiday-alert-trip" data-trip-start="2026-07-10" data-trip-end="2026-07-25" style="display:none;"></div>
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="section-eyebrow">The numbers</div>
        <h2>The workshop turned this into a <em>cheaper</em> trip</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Per-trip cap: ₹7L (₹2.5L flights / ₹3L hotels / ₹1.5L other). The big lever this time is the <strong>office-provided JW Marriott stay (8 free nights, Jul 13–21)</strong>. Because the office hotel IS the JW Marriott, the 2 arrival nights book at the same property on points — one seamless 10-night Tokyo stay, no second hotel. Net result: only 4 paid/points hotel nights (Kyoto), covered by the 40K cert + Bonvoy balance. Despite being 4 nights longer than the old plan, the all-in lands ~<strong>₹5.3L</strong> (75% of cap) — well under cap. Open-jaw flights (arrive NRT, depart KIX) avoid a backtrack.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="costs-grid">
      <div class="cost-card featured" data-reveal data-live-cost="A">
        <h4>Tokyo base + Kyoto tail (locked plan)</h4>
        <p class="cost-sub">All-in estimate, family of 4 · <span data-live-stamp>refresh for live rates</span></p>
        <div class="cost-row" data-live-flight="BLR-NRT-2026-07-10-2026-07-25">
          <span>Flights · BLR → NRT / KIX → BLR open-jaw × 4 <span data-live-flight-note style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);"></span></span>
          <strong>₹2,30,000</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="cost-row" data-live-hotel="Tokyo-Kyoto">
          <span>Hotels · Tokyo 8n office-FREE + 2n points (arrival) + Kyoto 4n (40K cert + points) <span data-live-hotel-note style="display:block;font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);"></span></span>
          <strong>₹35,000</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="cost-row"><span>Trains · Nozomi Tokyo→Kyoto + Haruka KIX + day-trip rail (Fuji/Hakone/Kamakura/Nara)</span><strong>₹55,000</strong></div>
        <div class="cost-row"><span>Cabs + Suica + Hakone Free Pass + Yamato bag forward</span><strong>₹28,000</strong></div>
        <div class="cost-row"><span>Food (Titanium breakfast saves ~35K over 10 Tokyo nights)</span><strong>₹80,000</strong></div>
        <div class="cost-row"><span>Activities · teamLab + Shibuya Sky + DisneySea + Sagano/Hozugawa + Klook</span><strong>₹55,000</strong></div>
        <div class="cost-row"><span>Visa eVisa × 4 + insurance + eSIM + misc</span><strong>₹45,000</strong></div>
        <div class="cost-row total"><span>Total</span><strong>₹5,28,000</strong></div>
        <div style="margin-top: 28px;">
          <div class="cap-bar"><div class="cap-fill" style="width: 75%"></div></div>
          <div class="cap-meta"><span>75% of Lux cap</span><span>~₹1.7L headroom</span></div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:12px; color: rgba(246,241,232,0.6); margin-top:12px;">Office covers Jul 13–21 hotel (~₹2.4L value, not in this total). Activities are up vs the old plan because DisneySea (full-day family ticket) + Fuji/Kamakura day trips were added; hotels are way down because of the free office nights.</div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="loyalty-strip" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Your leverage</div>
        <h3>Office nights free up the <em>40K cert</em> for Kyoto</h3>
        <p>With Tokyo hotel covered by the office, your Bonvoy balance and the <strong>40K free-night cert (expires Dec 31, 2026)</strong> point cleanly at the 4 Kyoto nights — apply the cert to one Westin Miyako Cat-5 night, points for the rest. The 2 Tokyo arrival nights (Jul 11–13) are a light points hit at the same JW Marriott, so there's no second check-in.</p>
        <p style="color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.5); font-size: 13px;">No Hakone overnight this trip — it's a day trip, so no ryokan spend. Avios + Cathay/Malaysia award routes remain an option for the open-jaw flights.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="loyalty-points">
        <div class="lp-item"><div class="lp-prog">Marriott Bonvoy</div><div class="lp-bal">359,343</div><div class="lp-tier">Titanium Elite</div></div>
        <div class="lp-item"><div class="lp-prog">40K free-night cert</div><div class="lp-bal">USE THIS</div><div class="lp-tier">Expires Dec 31, 2026</div></div>
        <div class="lp-item"><div class="lp-prog">Qatar Avios</div><div class="lp-bal">24,507</div><div class="lp-tier">OneWorld Sapphire</div></div>
        <div class="lp-item"><div class="lp-prog">Hilton Honors</div><div class="lp-bal">30,299</div><div class="lp-tier">Gold</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

